{"capturado_en": "2026-11-11T23:39:09+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tom Clancy's Splinter Cell Conviction™", "steam_appid": 33220, "required_age": "17", "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "An investigation into his daughter’s death unwittingly leads former agent Sam Fisher to discover he’s been betrayed by his prior agency, the Third Echelon. Now a renegade, Fisher finds himself in a race against time to thwart a deadly terrorist plot that threatens millions. <br>\t\t\t\t\t\tUniting revolutionary gameplay enhancements with a high-octane, no-holds-barred storyline, Tom Clancy’s Splinter Cell Conviction arms you to the teeth with all the high-tech weaponry and lethal skills of an elite operative and invites you to enter a dangerous world where justice means making your own rules.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>NEW LEVEL OF ACTION FOR SPLINTER CELL</strong> A full arsenal of cutting-edge innovations allows you to outflank foes with the Last Known Position™ system, tag and eliminate enemies using the Mark and Execute™ feature, and much more.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>BLOCKBUSTER EXPERIENCE</strong> A unique storytelling style keeps you on the edge of your seat as you navigate the explosive world of a renegade agent where trust is impossible and justice requires you to go above the law.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>JAW DROPPING VISUALS</strong> A revolutionary new graphic direction delivers an utterly seamless gameplay experience that’ll keep you totally engrossed in the story of Sam Fisher.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>EXPLOSIVE ONLINE PLAY</strong> Brand-new addictive multiplayer modes amp up the dramatic intensity like never before.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li></ul>", "about_the_game": "An investigation into his daughter’s death unwittingly leads former agent Sam Fisher to discover he’s been betrayed by his prior agency, the Third Echelon. Now a renegade, Fisher finds himself in a race against time 